xt":"After that, he let go and saw the girls who had been trying to drive him out as prey, and decided to abuse them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He originally became a teacher because he had a caring nature, and was a normal adult man with good sense and reason, but he was worn down by the daily attacks from the students, and became a completely different person after his encounter with the training room."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c148462"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d5fd0a10be8e0b0dbca1a5e09aaf4f4e94da88120ed8926b510e7924da01e43.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc5d95c34f8e2297d7d1eec275af1f14a6b53ec78d38a6c9bbbdfa202b30a4f3.webp","width":158,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p215","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:243","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p215","name":"BISHOP","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:37226:243","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p215","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p215","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p215","name":"BISHOP","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:139112:v53087","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p215","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p215","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p215","name":"BISHOP","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:139116:v53087","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p215","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p215","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p215","name":"BISHOP","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:142562:v53087","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p22585","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p22585","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p22585","name":"甜族星人","roleCodes":["publisher"],"i